    "extraction": "connected-component assignment to slots (objects larger than their grid slot survive unclipped)",
    "note": "art with strong perspective (pillar) is scaled down to fit its footprint canvas and is slightly narrower than the cell; icons/fx keep their native size, only scaled down when oversized"
